                     Color.TS.statusDanger (web text-rose-300), Color.TS.textMuted (web --text-muted),
                     Font.TS.label/caption (web text-xs), TSSpacing.xs; TSAnimation.fast (Sources/Design/TSDesign.swift).
P1/S10 i18n        : FormFieldStrings facade (NSLocalizedString table "FormField"); FormField.strings holds
                     "form.field.required"="required" + the web example key "alerts.signal"="Signal". No English literals in code.
P1/S11 telemetry   : FormFieldTelemetry.viewOpened(surface:) emits view.opened with slug "FormField" once (idempotent).
Accessibility      : VoiceOver single-element label "{label}, required"; error posts AccessibilityNotification.Announcement
                     (web role="alert" live behaviour); asterisk accessibilityHidden; Dynamic Type via fixedSize wrap;
                     Reduce-Motion via TSAnimation.fast(reduceMotion:). iOS 18 / macOS 15 minimums.

